: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"148\" height=\"120\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">오토캐드</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"84\" height=\"120\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">11.08~11.19</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(2주)</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"178\" height=\"120\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">- Auto CAD 기본운영체계, 기본툴, 응용과정 등</p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- Auto CAD 자격증 취득을 위한 교육</p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 취업후 실무에 적용 및 활용 가능한 전문 교육 실시</p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"91\" height=\"120\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">20명</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"83\" height=\"120\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17.5pt\">□ 접수방법 : <a href=\"http://hrd.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_self\">http://hrd.kumoh.ac.kr/</a> </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17.5pt\">접속 후 (수강신청 =&gt; 수강신청(왼쪽메뉴) =&gt; 수강 하고자 하는 과정으로 신청)</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;신청확인은 개별 통보 합니다. </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17.5pt\">□서류접수 방법: 추후 서류제출기간 홈페이지 공지<br>추후 서류제출기간에 서류 <span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff\">방문접수</span> 하여야 함.</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ <span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000\">서류접수 선착순으로 인원 선발예정 <br></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17.5pt\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000\">※ 추후 수요조사 결과나 서류접수 인원이 미달될 경우 폐강될 수 있음.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17.5pt\"><br>□ 문 의 처 : 054-478-7921</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
